{"id":"W15e343b04876fe0e921c30f6","zh":"隔振频率","en":"","name":"隔振频率","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W15e343b04876fe0e921c30f6","text":"隔振频率","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S138679b9cf260e6a80ec","source_id":"P135","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"此外,基于规范给出了不同类型建筑距线路中心的达标范围,设计车速80 km/h 及以下时,居民、文教建筑应距地铁线路中心20 m 以上,商业、工业建筑应距地铁线路中心10 m 以上;20~1 000 (kN∙s)/m 3减振垫阻尼以及5~24 Hz隔振频率对应室内振级都能满足商业、工业建筑的要求,采用 600 (kN∙s)/m 3以上的阻尼需要居民、文教建筑距线路中心10 m以上。","citations":[{"source_id":"P135","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S154a2990392bf8fd9874","source_id":"P135","page":10,"page_end":10,"language":"zh","text":"20~1 000 (kN∙s)/m 3减振垫阻尼以及 5~24 Hz 隔振频率对应室内振级都能满足商业、 工业区的要求。","citations":[{"source_id":"P135","page":10,"page_end":10}]}],"sources":{"P135":{"id":"P135","title":"基于车线隧系统的环境振动预测评估方法及参数影响研究","authors":"徐磊,胡逸宁,朱光楠,刘向明,刘虎兵,龙辉,黄厚龙","year":"2025","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20240828","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2025）","overview_slug":"2025-environmental-vibration-prediction-and-evaluation-method-based-on-vehicle-track-tunnel-system-and-ke"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"表征减振垫隔振特性的频率，本文通过垫层刚度设置不同取值。","language":"zh","source_id":"P135","paper_slug":"2025-environmental-vibration-prediction-and-evaluation-method-based-on-vehicle-track-tunnel-system-and-ke","title":"基于车线隧系统的环境振动预测评估方法及参数影响研究","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"Wdc2d13ee30afd58295b21b6a","name":"Vibration isolation frequency","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"Wdc2d13ee30afd58295b21b6a","name":"Vibration isolation frequency","language":"en","kind":"translation","l